{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_title", "source_sha256": "8ee4319864e51610bdbb682dd3727bc0c4125e9a1329bb09e106cbd3d32611bc", "ja": "思いは永遠に", "zh": "思念直到永远", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b6295a0f004255a532f698ddf9db7054fc714ed96d65366896daca66245e4c11", "ja": "『聖ミリオン女学園』新作試写会と舞台\n挨拶が終わり、一息つく昴、千早、可憐。\nしかし、本公開はまだこれから。今後の\nプロモーション活動に向け、まずは\n打ち上げで英気を養うアイドル達だった。", "zh": "『圣百万女学园』新作试映会和舞台\n致辞结束后，昴、千早和可怜稍稍\n歇了口气。\n然而，正式上映才刚刚开始。为了今后的\n宣传活动，偶像们先在庆功宴上\n养精蓄锐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1000_002chi", "source_sha256": "6aadfe1128b5dc9437948646afd2ab2f508e7b31861bb5cbb0fd95124a8799de", "ja": "可憐お姉さま。\n卒業、おめでとうございます……。", "zh": "可怜姐姐大人。\n祝贺您……毕业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "1aad0ac739387ff94cd82fa746c9f9de03a7c4516bad990045918a279e27dd04", "ja": "ありがとう。……この花のピンキーリングを。\n今日から、貴女がミス・ジャスミンよ。", "zh": "谢谢你。……这枚花朵尾戒给你。\n从今天起，你就是茉莉小姐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "e64abb13da6f59902979f0a6856c5227ca2219e6f8cdcc3500c6fa9b9ffe7c10", "ja": "可憐お姉さま……グスッ。わたしもいつか、\nおふたりみたいなステキな人になりたいです！", "zh": "可怜姐姐大人……呜。我总有一天，\n也要成为像两位那样了不起的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "a81c792ea27653128285155aee790ed8db24eebadd16ced3099982f7508a0aef", "ja": "ふぅ……終わりの舞台挨拶、緊張したーっ！\nああいうのって、全然慣れないよな。", "zh": "呼……最后的谢幕致辞，紧张死我了——！\n那种场合，真是一点都习惯不了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "468c0dcce69c9215c62bdd9077d2614418bb395d8d8668166123858cf66af1bb", "ja": "たまき、全然平気だよ？　もっと話したかった！", "zh": "环完全没问题哦？还想再多聊一会儿呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "31f0b6076c844bb79e2249b1c27aad628cca0296963c24c2a7f9bc849701dcf5", "ja": "環ちゃん、えらいなぁ……私も緊張しちゃって。\n役柄は堂々としてるのに、実際はこんなだし……うぅ。", "zh": "环真厉害啊……我也紧张得不行。明明角色表现得那么从容大方，现实中的我却是这个样子……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "c450d2d9458c40349aa35bffe3b8685fb1865b7d18461e37fecdb19c9a8fe071", "ja": "大丈夫です。そういう姿を見せるのも、ファンサービス\nの一つかと……ですよね？　{$P$}。", "zh": "没事的。展现出这副模样，也是粉丝福利\n的一种吧……对吧？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1008_p", "source_sha256": "170092716d29803d233253a50d0f0bfc41df44508c2706b6556544279997025f", "ja": "そうだな。役柄とのギャップを、\nファンのみんなも楽しんでくれたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是啊。和角色形象之间的反差，粉丝们应该也很享受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6ef5e564c8082bbaf2444b7eb0a862b6e6fb933068f90842392416527f179e2c", "ja": "……というわけで、これから本公開も控えているから。\nそっちの舞台挨拶も頼んだ！", "zh": "……所以说，之后还要迎来正式公映。\n到时候的映后见面会也拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "4b80ec1face4f8f70335ea7482bb450bc5f137053f2014e6b2b75d79150b2834", "ja": "それはいいけど、{$P$}ちゃん。\n今日の打ち上げは奮発してくれるんだろうネ？", "zh": "那倒没问题，不过，{$P$}，今天的庆功宴会大方一点吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3439413de03f4128fbf62084b92f706ef69594d6c1c41b44f5e43033329576b0", "ja": "む……まあ、そうだな。\nみんな頑張ってくれたし、こっちも頑張るか。", "zh": "唔……也是啊。\n大家都这么努力了，我也得加把劲才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "7de80b7819ff89065f0023fd53c568905d7e5c4451843a2c8031393ce3400ef8", "ja": "みんな、早く支度しようか！\nそれじゃ、{$P$}……。", "zh": "大家，快点准备吧！\n那么，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_14_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "c91dcae3e20064e546d22f995826f28866ac17bd6ca29b7b05b2795256d1cff2", "ja": "ごきげんよう……♪", "zh": "贵安……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
